            "review_text": "Kray16\nNew York City, New York798 contributions\n0\nGood value for money\nOct 2017 • Solo\nI had a quick lunch here while walking back to central Hanoi from the lake. The place is smallish but clean, with colourful decor and wifi. The restaurant is beef-themed and I ordered the My Xao - fried noodles with beef and vegetables. The food arrived in 5-7 minutes, was quite tolerable and enough for refueling after walking in the hot sun for three hours. Prices are reasonable.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten November 13, 2017",
