            "review_text": "moonlotus18\nHamilton, New Zealand2312 contributions\n0\nExcellent food and great value\nApr 2017 • Family\nThis place was recommended to us by our hotel staff. We came here after visiting the West Lake. What a treat. It was lunch time and the place was brimming with locals. They had 2 shops, one across the other from the road. We were recommended the fresh spring rolls which were fresh and delicious. We selected a few other items from the menu board and all were tasty. Condiments like chilly oil, fish sauce, etc are freely available on the table for you to help yourself to. Very reasonable priced too.\nHighly recommended. Will go back if we have a chance to again.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten May 18, 2017",
