            "review_title": "Review at Huong Mai",
            "review_text": "Dave C\nCalgary, Canada80 contributions\n0\nBest place to buy packaged coffee\nOct 2015 • Couples\nAfter walking around the entire old quarter, it is obvious that everyone has (more or less) the same variety of coffees to sell in bulk. Huong Mai is by far the cleanest and most professional shop. More than just a retail store- it's owned by the plantation, so you know there's a direct distribution path. There's a nice table where you can sit and drink coffee- sold by the cup, and also free samples of other coffees and teas. \nThe packaged beans may be a little pricier than the others, but you can be confident in its authenticity. And still a very good deal compared to what this coffee sells for in the states (I paid around $8 U.S. for 125g of the most expensive beans). \nIf you're a coffee lover, this is a great place to sample some exotic blends and purchase some quality beans to bring home.\nRead more\nWritten October 21, 2015",
